	UpgradeDescription(1)="<font color=\"#4682B4\">Killing Frost:</font> Every <font color=\"#FFFFFF\">6rd</font> kill triggers a <font color=\"#87CEEB\">powerful freeze explosion</font> at the target. Kills decay after <font color=\"#F0F8FF\">8 seconds</font>"

